8f4e/v1

note
; @config testRuntime.enabled true

Group-local entries may use the same name as the generated host initializer.
The host initializer sets memory defaults before the group entry is called.
noteEnd

entry test
group voice
entry main
module driver
int& stateValue &state:value

push *stateValue
assertEqual 7
call initDefaults
push *stateValue
assertEqual 9
moduleEnd
entryEnd

entry initDefaults
module state
int value 7
push &value
push 9
store
moduleEnd
entryEnd
groupEnd
entryEnd
